  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provincial Water Supply and Sanitation Project (PWSSP) - Cambodia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will extend and improve performance of water and santitation services in four provincial towns to give residents greater access to safe piped water supply and improved access to effective wastewater and septage services.</narrative>
